  "parts": [
    {
      "extracted_at": "2026-07-20T09:32:17Z",
      "payload": {
        "chunks": [
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_7_MDA"
            },
            "chunk_type": "segment",
            "content": "FoA revenue in 2023 increased $18.56 billion, or 16%, compared to 2022. The increase was almost entirely driven by advertising revenue.",
            "entity_name": "META Family of Apps Segment",
            "entity_type_entity": "RevenueSegment",
            "valid_from": "2024-02-01",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_7_MDA"
            },
            "chunk_type": "segment",
            "content": "FoA income from operations in 2023 increased $20.21 billion, or 47%, compared to 2022. The increase was mostly driven by higher advertising revenue and a decrease in marketing and sales expenses.",
            "entity_name": "META Family of Apps Segment",
            "entity_type_entity": "RevenueSegment",
            "valid_from": "2024-02-01",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_7_MDA"
            },
            "chunk_type": "segment",
            "content": "RL revenue in 2023 decreased $263 million, or 12%, compared to 2022. The decrease in RL revenue was mostly driven by a net decrease in the volume of Meta Quest sales.",
            "entity_name": "META Reality Labs Segment",
            "entity_type_entity": "RevenueSegment",
            "valid_from": "2024-02-01",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_7_MDA"
            },
            "chunk_type": "segment",
            "content": "RL loss from operations in 2023 increased $2.40 billion, or 18%, compared to 2022. The increase in loss was mainly due to an increase in payroll and related expenses and a decrease in RL revenue.",
            "entity_name": "META Reality Labs Segment",
            "entity_type_entity": "RevenueSegment",
            "valid_from": "2024-02-01",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_7_MDA"
            },
            "chunk_type": "material_event",
            "content": "Beginning in 2022, we initiated several measures to pursue greater efficiency and to realign our business and strategic priorities. As of December 31, 2023, we have completed the data center initiatives and the employee layoffs, and substantially completed the facilities consolidation initiatives.",
            "entity_name": "META 2022-2023 Restructuring",
            "entity_type_entity": "MaterialEvent",
            "valid_from": "2024-02-01",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_7_MDA"
            },
            "chunk_type": "capital_return",
            "content": "Prior to 2024, we had never declared or paid any cash dividend on our common stock. On February 1, 2024 we announced the initiation of our first ever cash dividend program. This cash dividend of $0.50 per share of Class A common stock and Class B common stock (together, the \"common stock\") is equivalent to $2.00 per share on an annual basis. The first cash dividend will be paid on March 26, 2024 to all holders of record of common stock at the close of business on February 22, 2024.",
            "entity_name": "META Q1-2024 Inaugural Cash Dividend",
            "entity_type_entity": "CapitalReturn",
            "valid_from": "2024-02-01",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_7_MDA"
            },
            "chunk_type": "capital_return",
            "content": "In January 2024, an additional $50 billion of repurchases was authorized under this program.",
            "entity_name": "META January 2024 $50B Repurchase Authorization",
            "entity_type_entity": "CapitalReturn",
            "valid_from": "2024-02-01",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_7_MDA"
            },
            "chunk_type": "capital_return",
            "content": "In 2023, we repurchased and subsequently retired 92 million shares of our Class A common stock for an aggregate amount of $20.03 billion, which includes the 1% excise tax accruals as a result of the Inflation Reduction Act of 2022. As of December 31, 2023, $30.93 billion remained available and authorized for repurchases.",
            "entity_name": "META FY2023 Class A Common Stock Repurchases",
            "entity_type_entity": "CapitalReturn",
            "valid_from": "2024-02-01",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_7_MDA"
            },
            "chunk_type": "capital_structure_event",
            "content": "As of December 31, 2023, we had outstanding long-term debt in the form of senior unsecured notes for an aggregate principal amount of $18.50 billion. These notes were issued in multiple series, which mature from 2027 through 2063.",
            "entity_name": "META May 2023 Senior Unsecured Notes Issuance",
            "entity_type_entity": "CapitalStructureEvent",
            "valid_from": "2024-02-01",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_7_MDA",
              "update_type": "confirmation"
            },
            "chunk_type": "guidance",
            "content": "We anticipate making capital expenditures of approximately $30 billion to $37 billion in 2024.",
            "entity_name": "META FY2024 Capital Expenditures Guidance",
            "entity_type_entity": "GuidanceUpdate",
            "valid_from": "2024-02-01",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_7_MDA",
              "update_type": "confirmation"
            },
            "chunk_type": "guidance",
            "content": "If our stock price remains constant to the January 26, 2024 price, and absent any changes to U.S. tax law, we expect our effective tax rate for the full year 2024 to be in the mid-teens.",
            "entity_name": "META FY2024 Effective Tax Rate Guidance",
            "entity_type_entity": "GuidanceUpdate",
            "valid_from": "2024-02-01",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_7_MDA",
              "update_type": "confirmation"
            },
            "chunk_type": "guidance",
            "content": "In 2023, our RL segment reduced our overall operating profit by approximately $16.12 billion, and we expect our RL operating losses to increase meaningfully in 2024.",
            "entity_name": "META Reality Labs FY2024 Operating Loss Guidance",
            "entity_type_entity": "GuidanceUpdate",
            "valid_from": "2024-02-01",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_7_MDA"
            },
            "chunk_type": "risk_factor",
            "content": "Our advertising revenue has been, and we expect will continue to be, adversely affected by reduced marketer spending as a result of limitations on our ad targeting and measurement tools arising from changes to the regulatory environment and third-party mobile operating systems and browsers.",
            "entity_name": "META Ad Targeting Regulatory and Platform Risk",
            "entity_type_entity": "Risk",
            "valid_from": "2024-02-01",
            "valid_until": null
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "section_type": "Item_7_MDA"
            },
            "chunk_type": "risk_factor",
            "content": "While we saw improvement in business and macroeconomic conditions in 2023, continued business, macroeconomic, and geopolitical uncertainty remains, which could impact our financial results in future periods.",
            "entity_name": "META Macroeconomic and Geopolitical Advertising Risk",
            "entity_type_entity": "Risk",
            "valid_from": "2024-02-01",
            "valid_until": null
          }
        ],
